    "identifier": "reapers-swing",
    "description": "<p>As a requirement to activate this jutsu, you must be targeting a creature who is either; Grappled, Prone, Restrained, Stunned, or Unconscious.</p>\n<p>You swing your blade with such ferocity that the air and other materials or objects in its path doesn’t recognize that it’s been slashed.</p>\n<p>Make a melee taijutsu attack with a +1 bonus to its attacks critical threat range, dealing your weapons damage + 6d6.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining a rank of Bleed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: On a critical hit, you can make an additional attack targeting a different creature.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
